<title>UK: Argenta Nederland sets 2.0 bln Lux franc 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Argenta Nederland sets 2.0 bln Lux franc 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BCEE.</p>
<p>BORROWER   ARGENTA NEDERLAND NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  ARGENTA BANQUE D'EPARGNE AND SOCIETE</p>
<p>D'INVESTISSEMENT ARGENTA.</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.10	MATURITY    20.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    20.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 100	 PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
